50
00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:48.060
Pakati pa maso awiriwo, mawonekedwe a cornea osasunthika, chigamba chakuda chomwe chili mkati mwake

51
00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:54.017
reflex ya diso limodzi kapena onse awiri, kapena reflex kulibe.

52
00:02:54.017 --> 00:02:55.100
Zachilendo

